# Changelog

This repository tracks Cloudron packaging changes for Fizzy.

## v1.2.4

- Corrective Cloudron package release to republish the supported `stable` and `v1.2.4` image tags.
- Clarify release guidance to use `stable` or an explicit version tag instead of `latest`.

## v1.2.3

- Sync upstream `basecamp/fizzy` through `7ab6b43e0`.
- Preserve Cloudron signup gating while taking upstream passkey, import, and account settings changes.
- Bump Cloudron package metadata and release index for the next community app release.

See git tags (vX.Y.Z) and CloudronVersions.json for published versions.
